<title>USA: Ucar Q1 oper shr $0.76 vs $0.73.</title>
<headline>Ucar Q1 oper shr $0.76 vs $0.73.</headline>
<dateline>DANBURY, Conn. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>UCAR INTERNATIONAL INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>		  (Dollars in millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>						     Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							   March 31,</p>
<p>						 1997		   1996</p>
<p> Net Sales				    $238		  $243</p>
